{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"4679e356791c293e","type":"group","x":-1040,"y":400,"width":4720,"height":4880,"label":"static multiple issue"},
		{"id":"9d8ad19468b6f3c3","type":"group","x":1247,"y":504,"width":2322,"height":4707,"label":"MIPS-64"},
		{"id":"592897ea45be32a8","type":"group","x":3840,"y":400,"width":2620,"height":2000,"label":"Dynamic pipeline scheduling"},
		{"id":"ad53465d1be53d4e","type":"group","x":-1020,"y":524,"width":1200,"height":1962,"label":"IA-64"},
		{"id":"7462cc65aef4c3b3","type":"group","x":7040,"y":-305,"width":1121,"height":1411,"label":"speculation 定義"},
		{"id":"620650802c240525","type":"group","x":320,"y":524,"width":840,"height":1407,"label":"VLIW"},
		{"id":"f12e6e3aebb7393c","type":"text","text":"- 硬體簡單，可擴充\n- 缺點\n\t- 就是 Compiler 變複雜時間變長\n\t- hazard 只有 NOP 在 hardware\n\t- Object code 不相容，就是 four 和 two way 的程式碼不可能一樣，因為他們主要功能單元就不同個數了，最主要超長指令排的也不一樣\n\t- memory 的頻寬要大\n\t- memory 要變大，因為 Code bloat 本身要大因為 loop unrolling","x":812,"y":1079,"width":328,"height":363,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e51fcae5aae211d8","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/20-MIPS-64.png","x":1267,"y":1089,"width":546,"height":340},
		{"id":"4bae1821b13c2094","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/25-MIPS-64.png","x":1312,"y":1484,"width":456,"height":260},
		{"id":"f0356d3d09b99f9d","type":"text","text":"假設我們知道 addi 要放在最上面才會對程式碼的效能最好，這個的原因就是有人試了很多次才知道這樣排是最好的，因為一開始減了 16 所以要把全部都先加回去 16 (offset) 這樣就不會有問題了","x":2320,"y":3889,"width":360,"height":145,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"995252b625b1c24c","type":"text","text":"1. 放 `lw` 指令那發現 `addu` 和`lw` 有 load-used data hazard 所以需要空一個 NOP\n2. 因為 addu 和 sw 有 data hazard 所以也要等 addu 執行完\n3. addi 有 WAR 的 data dep 那麼因為只是單純的加減法，所以可以把指令往前放，然後加上 sw 的 offset，這樣就不會影響指令結果，那也可以放在 clock cycle 1 的地方也可以放在 2 的地方但是放在 1 的地方 2 就會變成 empty package 那麼不是很好。\n4. 最後把 NOP 填上去不然指令是空的會有問題","x":1836,"y":2068,"width":468,"height":284,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3ca4d1885175f585","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/40-MIPS-64.png","x":1806,"y":3664,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"251f86e1d60c2bfa","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/39-MIPS-64.png","x":1806,"y":3324,"width":400,"height":229},
		{"id":"ecd5aef750476a0e","type":"text","text":"但是這樣 ILP 不是很好，理想的 clock cycle = 16*4 =64，但是還是比 1-issue 還快，主要不好的原因是指令數太少了還有都是 data hazard 太多了，那指令數太少可以靠 `Loop unrolling` 來解決","x":1836,"y":2464,"width":340,"height":145,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f61a0b9c2d477c92","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/37-MIPS-64.png","x":1806,"y":2684,"width":400,"height":218},
		{"id":"f02d246df0c92b78","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/38-MIPS-64.png","x":1806,"y":3024,"width":400,"height":221},
		{"id":"eceb7ad8a29ecda0","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/15-MIPS-64.png","x":1340,"y":804,"width":400,"height":181},
		{"id":"2bcd7d4734b85e25","type":"text","text":"VLIW 他為了增加他的擴充性，他的硬體解決 hazard 只會有 NOP，沒有 forwarding path","x":841,"y":884,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"33a70408f676d05d","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/26-VLIW - 硬體簡單,可擴充.png","x":340,"y":1664,"width":400,"height":247},
		{"id":"ed946c6a1f830f77","type":"text","text":"執行指令的單元不同 instr. group 和 instr. bundle\n- instr. bundle 就是使用大量的 forwarding path 就算有 data dep 那麼也可以夠過 forwarding path 快速獲得資料\n- instr. group 基本繼承了 VLIW 的特性","x":-427,"y":1791,"width":474,"height":141,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e3fcebca2beeb9bd","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/21-VLIW - 硬體簡單,可擴充.png","x":340,"y":1333,"width":400,"height":219},
		{"id":"ae7e05e17b5084a7","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/19-VLIW - 硬體簡單,可擴充.png","x":340,"y":1024,"width":399,"height":191},
		{"id":"336c0f75b4100a5b","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/31-IA-64.png","x":-1000,"y":1991,"width":400,"height":171},
		{"id":"011adab282fec53a","type":"text","text":"IA-64 架構結合了 VLIW 的優點，並且比 VLIW 更具彈性。  \nIA-64 採用了兩種不同的彈性概念：**指令群組 (instruction group)** 與 **指令組合 (bundle)**。  \n\n1. **指令群組 (instruction group)**  \n\t- Compiler 做的\n\t- 一連串指令但是沒有跟 reg 有 dep，沒有就會給他們一個 tag。  \n\t- 若硬體資源足夠，群組中的指令可以同時（平行）執行。  \n\n2. **指令組合 (bundle)**  \n\t- 如果沒有任何一個 group 那麼他就會以每 3 個指令變成一個 bundle\n\t\t-  每個 bundle 包含：  \n\t\t\t - 一個 **5-bit 樣板欄位 (template field)**  \n\t\t\t\t - 樣板欄位指定 bundle 中每條指令所需的執行單元。  \n\t\t\t - 三個長度為 **41 bits** 的指令  \n\t\t\t- 指令以 **128 位元 (128 bits)** 編碼。  \n\t- 五種不同的執行單元包括：整數 ALU、非整數 ALU, FP, memory, 和 branch。  \n","x":-540,"y":1311,"width":700,"height":415,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a0169c07c90d1f84","type":"text","text":"這個就是一個指令那麼他就是用來避免 control hazard ","x":-427,"y":2049,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"71d2312a5c71b401","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/24-IA-64.png","x":-1000,"y":1410,"width":399,"height":217},
		{"id":"2856ff190d38cfcc","type":"text","text":"每次都抓一條超長指令，但是在 instr. stream 其實就 scheduler 好了（大概沒有 hazard）","x":840,"y":724,"width":279,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"01573203faa84d42","type":"text","text":"ALU/B 和 Lw/Sw  1 個 Issue pack 這個是 MIPS-64 的規定，因為 ALU/B 不需要 access memory","x":1780,"y":559,"width":283,"height":115,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"68133a30c130dfb9","type":"text","text":"這邊有 4 個指令包，假設沒有 hazard，所以就是沒有 data dep，因為有 data dep forward 也救不到","x":1780,"y":852,"width":323,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0410614672838b4b","type":"text","text":"他就是有提供一些特殊指令來增加 ILP 那麼 intel 就叫他 EPIC","x":-540,"y":618,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"8a1af40a0a4a262c","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/13-VLIW.png","x":340,"y":649,"width":400,"height":235},
		{"id":"ecc0dfd2bf174fc5","type":"text","text":"他這樣只會有一個 Control hazard 其實就是他只會做一個，這樣就不會有 Control hazard 因為根本就沒有 Control branch，在翻譯過後，但是他沒有辦法消除 loop 相關指令但是他只能消除 if 等等判斷指令，那麼如果今天需要消除還是使用 loop unrolling","x":-550,"y":2271,"width":360,"height":175,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3a48d30555feb0e6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/36-IA-64.png","x":-1000,"y":2251,"width":399,"height":214},
		{"id":"610f3ed35cf605d0","type":"text","text":"1. IA-64 擁有比 MIPS 更多的暫存器，包括：\n   - 128 個整數暫存器\n   - 128 個浮點暫存器\n   - 8 個分支專用暫存器\n   - 64 個 1-bit 條件暫存器\n\n2. IA-64 將指令放入 **bundles**（指令組），其格式固定，並且明確標示相依關係。\n\n3. IA-64 支援特殊指令與 **推測執行 (speculation)**、分支消除 (branch elimination)，能提升可利用的 ILP（指令級平行性）。\n","x":-540,"y":913,"width":500,"height":267,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1220f4d4076866c6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/18-IA-64.png","x":-1000,"y":953,"width":400,"height":187},
		{"id":"0ad759739396c718","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/12-IA-64.png","x":-1000,"y":556,"width":399,"height":208},
		{"id":"2841579d104bffd3","type":"text","text":"-16 的原因是因爲現在每次都有4 個 body 那麼 4*4=16 所以他要跳的話就是以 16 為一個單位跳，最後只要跑 4 次就可以了","x":2300,"y":3245,"width":326,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1bcc8f29cf54ec14","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/11-MIPS-64.png","x":1340,"y":524,"width":400,"height":184},
		{"id":"3af728f2eb8108bc","type":"text","text":"可以把 Very wide Instr. 看成一個 instr. package, 那麼package 放幾個 instr. 代表他是幾 way 的像是圖片中的就是 4-way, 那麼 hardware 就會有幾個功能單元","x":840,"y":544,"width":280,"height":145,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"06994d14ef668c0a","type":"text","text":"那麼還不能作 instr. scheduler，因為現在還有很多 data dep 那麼 compiler 如果比較大膽的調整指令那麼有可能原本只有 data dep 會變成 data hazard，那麼這樣就會造成 `namedependence`  或是 `antidependence`","x":2296,"y":4174,"width":364,"height":145,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1832676fdab12569","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/42-MIPS-64.png","x":2740,"y":4138,"width":399,"height":218},
		{"id":"971cd83605f8d0c4","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/41-MIPS-64.png","x":1806,"y":4004,"width":400,"height":229},
		{"id":"bbc7b7aa2f6090b6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/43-MIPS-64.png","x":2260,"y":4524,"width":400,"height":218},
		{"id":"9ff93b4584962ad1","type":"text","text":"那麼理想的是 8/16=1/2 但是因為有放兩個 NOP 所以就會變成 8/14","x":3260,"y":5106,"width":289,"height":85},
		{"id":"9b324358d047e064","type":"text","text":"- 就是展開指令，那麼就是把 Loop 分析展開，那 Body 數變多了那指令數也變多，那指令變多那麼就有可能可以排得比較好","x":2300,"y":2720,"width":326,"height":118,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"53840a725ae138d3","type":"text","text":"true dependence 就是 RAW 他們真正會造成，資料相依才就做 true dependence","x":3220,"y":4204,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"36ffc91cdf90b4b4","type":"text","text":"總夠有 16 次要跑但是每次只能跑 4 個那 4 個是 8 個 clock，那麼就是 4*8=32","x":2800,"y":4974,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"10fe73233641b1dc","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/45-MIPS-64.png","x":2800,"y":5124,"width":397,"height":48},
		{"id":"34862e651ebdc950","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/44-MIPS-64.png","x":2216,"y":4838,"width":443,"height":221},
		{"id":"d2f451854c8be62f","type":"text","text":"這也是經過很多次排法才會有的結果，因為第 1 個 lw 變成 0 的原因是因為 addi 再一起所以拿不到減掉 16 的所以就不用在加 16，那麼第 2 個 lw 他也會讀錯，但是可以用 forwarding path 救","x":2800,"y":4824,"width":488,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"27bc41e35a5d0d1a","type":"text","text":"利用 registry renaming 解決 WAR WAW","x":3920,"y":2175,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e8fd1948dd4c3db4","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/33-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4260,"y":2112,"width":400,"height":186},
		{"id":"62e3a9dc391174fe","type":"text","text":"- IF stage 因為一次是抓 8 Bytes 所以 PC 要加 8，\n- EXE stage 其實下面那個因為他是 LW/SW 那其實可以用 Adder 就好了成本較低\n- MEM stage 那 ALU/Beq 他不需要存取 MEM\n- WB stage 他們兩個都需要 WB 所以就要改 Reg file","x":1883,"y":1141,"width":360,"height":236,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ceeee88c63621e6d","type":"text","text":"MIPS-64 2-issue 他是有 16 個 forwarding path 現在原本 1-issue 他只有 4 條那麼他可以拉給另一個 issue 所以變成 8 條那麼另一個 issue 也可以拉上去給上面的 issue 所以他會有8*2 =  16 條","x":1840,"y":1557,"width":403,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"af0776b199e496c8","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/06-計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pi.png","x":3364,"y":-258,"width":400,"height":220},
		{"id":"f3b096565f6a7ae6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/07-multiple issue.png","x":2923,"y":107,"width":460,"height":156},
		{"id":"6df50d03dd13fc7f","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/01-計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pi.png","x":2674,"y":-968,"width":399,"height":42},
		{"id":"19b205ae0ef0e96c","type":"text","text":"流水線 (Pipelining) 利用指令之間潛在的並行性。  \n這種並行性稱為 **instruction-level parallelism (ILP)**。  \n有兩種主要方法可以增加 ILP 的潛在數量。  \n\n---\n\n第一種方法是增加流水線的 **深度 (depth)**，  \n以便同時重疊更多的指令，稱為 **superpipeline**。  \n\n---\n\n另一種方法是複製電腦的內部組件，  \n讓它能在每個流水線階段同時執行多個指令。  \n這種技術的通用名稱是 **multiple issue**，就是大水管裡面放小水管\n","x":2036,"y":-726,"width":495,"height":358},
		{"id":"bde1a3028f8924c2","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/02-計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pi.png","x":2674,"y":-768,"width":399,"height":144},
		{"id":"d01c5803af3e65c6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/03-有兩個事情一定要做在 Multiple.png","x":3422,"y":-617,"width":399,"height":181},
		{"id":"5fa6969f65bbc505","type":"text","text":"multiple issue","x":2804,"y":-148,"width":134,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0fc8390152272083","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/04-multiple issue.png","x":2674,"y":-478,"width":399,"height":220},
		{"id":"540258830c7fa72a","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/35-MIPS-64.png","x":1340,"y":2240,"width":399,"height":224},
		{"id":"a4d74d53d7e2c78c","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/30-MIPS-64.png","x":1340,"y":1844,"width":400,"height":224},
		{"id":"f3c3b714463af9ed","type":"text","text":"如果不考慮 hazard 的問題 1-issue 的要跑 16*5=80 次","x":1820,"y":1924,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ea7bf9ee610d85da","type":"text","text":"- 都會 data hazard 在這種 pipeline\n- RAW 是用 forwarding path 解決\n- WAW 或是 WAR 那麼就是用 reorder buffer 解決 hazard 也就是使用了 in-order commit","x":4278,"y":1124,"width":406,"height":151,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"64a4d6b3634d2f13","type":"text","text":"指令包就是看他幾個功能單元，就是幾個 issue 的 multiple pipeline","x":4340,"y":944,"width":282,"height":70,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7f0429c4ec7944ff","type":"text","text":"在軟體推測中，編譯器通常會 **插入額外的指令**，用來檢查推測的正確性。  \n若推測錯誤，則會呼叫 **修正流程 (fix-up routine)** 來處理。  \n\n在硬體推測中，處理器通常會 **暫存 (buffer)** 推測結果，直到確認不再是推測為止。  \n- **若推測正確**：允許緩衝區內容寫入暫存器或記憶體，完成指令。  \n- **若推測錯誤**：硬體會清空緩衝區，並重新執行正確的指令序列。  \n","x":7523,"y":895,"width":618,"height":191,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"5a7fcf61a5016a52","type":"text","text":"- 一個檢測是不是猜對或錯誤\n- 和猜錯還原的方法","x":7547,"y":735,"width":257,"height":61,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0ab3266d978e1c50","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/14-speculation 定義 - 一個檢測是不是猜對或錯誤.png","x":7078,"y":731,"width":364,"height":69},
		{"id":"619ba852e162fdd5","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/17-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4896,"y":944,"width":594,"height":360},
		{"id":"b7efbe37918ed6e0","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/27-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4896,"y":1753,"width":594,"height":237},
		{"id":"7ab856b623402183","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/16-speculation 定義.png","x":7080,"y":905,"width":359,"height":171},
		{"id":"3abf39d86073dc02","type":"text","text":"不管哪種方法他都要讓 ILP 增加那麼這個就叫 speculation","x":7134,"y":-285,"width":250,"height":55,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1b563b00b757d438","type":"text","text":"就是去猜指令性質後續指令可不可以被提早執行，讓前面的 packages 盡量滿也就是說如果是 4-issues 的 pipeline 那盡量湊滿 4 個指令成為一個 package 不然他會讓 ILP 下降，因為如果湊不滿需要用 NOP","x":7611,"y":-119,"width":304,"height":175,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"124123008bb18779","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/08-speculation 定義.png","x":7060,"y":138,"width":400,"height":52},
		{"id":"a9b941d99885e168","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/09-speculation 定義.png","x":7604,"y":164,"width":399,"height":164},
		{"id":"3272a5b530208b80","type":"text","text":"- Ex 1 是指我可以猜 beq 後面的指令可不可以往前放然後讓 ILP 提升，跟前面解決 hazard 的目的不太一樣。\n- Ex 2 是指如果對 Memory 有 dep 的話那麼就不能超前執行（假設對到的位置相同），那麼他就不能超前執行，如果沒有一樣那麼就可以調整那麼可以增加 ILP 反之亦然，必須等到 runtime 的時候才能知到。","x":7611,"y":364,"width":387,"height":231,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2f81190eff1fdb20","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/34-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4910,"y":2224,"width":560,"height":140},
		{"id":"c611489a04d35800","type":"text","text":"現今的 pipelines 大部分都是用 in-order commit","x":5541,"y":2260,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c05854a36a1732cc","type":"text","text":"1. instr. fetch, multiple function units, commit unit  區分成三種\n2. IF/ID 之後會有送到對應的功能單元前等待\n3. 那麼就需要 reservation stations, 那麼會存 operands 和 operation, 等到了就可以運算\n4. 最後運算後會放到 commit unit 的 reorder buffer 上面儲存，等到安全再寫到 reg 或是 MEM","x":5633,"y":1031,"width":523,"height":187,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7919c6d6a18d1c89","type":"text","text":"- 有兩個事情一定要做在 Multiple\n\t- Multiple issue 如果指令有 dep 那麼就不能放在同一個 package，要精準的安排\n\t- Compiler 解決 hazard 靠 NOP 等等方式那他就叫作 static multiple issue\n\t- 如果是在 runtime 的時候由 Processor 來解決問題的畫那就叫作 Dynamic multiple issue","x":4177,"y":-855,"width":415,"height":212,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cff0dbdd05f35ae4","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/05-data hazard.png","x":4177,"y":-478,"width":399,"height":193},
		{"id":"28ec8f89189a255d","type":"text","text":"superpipeline 因為太長了所以 Clock cycle time 會變慢，因為以前說 speedup 上升的原因是因為 stage 的個數變多，那 hazard 的逞罰和實作會變難","x":4192,"y":-1008,"width":400,"height":85,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"02cd00c6f44f43b2","type":"text","text":"- data hazard\n\t- 這樣只有 or and\n\t- 下面的lw 和 or and sub 都有 load used data hazard\n- Control hazard \n\t- 如果猜錯那麼就要殺 4 比起一般的 pipeline 還要來得多（3）","x":4633,"y":-431,"width":522,"height":154,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"894fb3f4fe600ac0","type":"text","text":"dataflow 就是這樣那麼就是需要安照這個目前指令的順序，但是在這之間沒有 data dep 的指令可以移動。","x":6190,"y":1820,"width":250,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"73edf9205e9da28d","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/28-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":5895,"y":1764,"width":209,"height":226},
		{"id":"e39e3a10815e7b87","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/32-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4916,"y":2064,"width":554,"height":80},
		{"id":"df7684d3ba7ff1bf","type":"text","text":"你要 Commit 的時候 pipelined 的執行順序和寫入 MEM 或是 visible-reg 順序要相同","x":5541,"y":2059,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6b6ebe7c00907cf9","type":"text","text":"- Reservation station 就是 Buffer，指令會在這邊排隊那麼可能可以等前面指令因為可能會有 data dep 或是可以 forward 解決 data hazard\n- in-order 就是 compiler 的指令順序\n- Commit unit, out-of-order 因為在 function unit 執行的時候不是照著順序執行所以需要 reorder buffer 等到安全的時候去 commit 那麼安全就是照著原本指令資料流原本的順序\n- Commit unit 有錯誤在這個課本的圖片中，應該要把 instr. fetch and decode unit 拉一個線到 commit unit 這邊這樣 reorder buffer 就會知道原本的資料流或是順序是怎麼樣的\n- 任何一個功能單元都會有 forwarding path 也就是綠色線但是比綠色線多很多條例如：int 可以連線到 floating point function unit 到他的 reservation station 上面，那麼 reorders buffer 的資料就是計算完的資料那麼他們也可以 forwarding 到 reservation station \n","x":5716,"y":1304,"width":566,"height":358,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"02ada57d00ace19d","type":"text","text":"out-of-order execution 就是一個指令的等待他不會造成後續指令的等待","x":5541,"y":1829,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"613d269f96700260","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/29-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4260,"y":1820,"width":400,"height":211},
		{"id":"6bbe4ce44de28b91","type":"text","text":"anti output dependencies 其實就是硬體資源衝突，用 register renaming 去解決","x":3860,"y":1496,"width":250,"height":78,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3e8af26538e26461","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/23-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4896,"y":1408,"width":593,"height":254},
		{"id":"8d43f8e1920a145e","type":"text","text":"他就是一種可以提供指令reordering 避免 pipeline stalls","x":5604,"y":420,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0365fdecebad714c","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/22-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4190,"y":1375,"width":583,"height":320},
		{"id":"afeb9859c4bca0c6","type":"text","text":"最多只在 reservation station 卡住，因為被卡住也很快被解掉了因為有 forwarding path","x":5645,"y":804,"width":376,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b812da3a5bed47fa","type":"text","text":"BTW 課本只介紹 dynamic multiple issue processor schedular","x":5640,"y":902,"width":381,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e01556260a8c1bf9","type":"text","text":"(Dynamic multiple-issue processors) 也稱為 **超純量處理器 (superscalar processors)**，或簡稱 **superscalars**。  \n\n**Superscalar**：一種先進的管線化技術，使處理器能在一個時脈週期內執行多條指令，方法是於執行過程中選擇合適的指令。  \n\n要在超純量處理器上獲得良好效能，仍需要 **編譯器 (compiler)** 嘗試安排指令，將相依性分開，藉此提升指令發射率。  \n\n即使有編譯器的排程，不論程式是否經過排程，硬體都能保證正確執行。  \n","x":4843,"y":584,"width":699,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5cb0a3bbeec6c2f8","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_9_Advance_pipeline/10-Dynamic pipeline schedul.png","x":4856,"y":424,"width":675,"height":50}
	],
